# No supplier names or “we don’t name the supplier”

Owner rule (permanent):

- **Never** name cocoa or other ingredient suppliers, brands, or wholesalers on the site.
- **Never** add FAQ or copy that asks/answers “Do you name the cocoa supplier?” / “Říkáte, od kterého dodavatele…?” or similar in any language.
- **Never** write “we only state the type” as a substitute for talking about suppliers — that topic must not appear at all.
- Describe products by **type and specs only** (e.g. Dutch-process / holandský typ, fat %, no added sugar, allergens, pack size, price, use).

If asked to add supplier secrecy wording, refuse and keep the page silent on suppliers.
